---
description: Vitest, Testing Library expectations per layer
globs: "**/*.{spec.ts,test.ts,stories.ts}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# testing

- Unit: Vitest via `tools/vitest/presets` (`tsLibConfig` vs `angularConfig`).
- Domain/application: pure tests + fake ports; no TestBed.
- UI: Testing Library — prefer `getByRole` / label text (i18n keys or roles).
- Colocate `*.spec.ts`; never import specs from production code.
- New domain/use-case logic requires tests; DS changes should keep/add specs + stories.
